{"title": "Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb (Condition)", "pageid": 31242, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Crowd Control Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Once per round if her offspring is attacked, this creature will try to encase the attacker in a <a href=\"/wiki/Gossamer_Tomb\" title=\"Gossamer Tomb\">Gossamer Tomb</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>It works not only when her <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spiderling\" title=\"Phase Spiderling\">offspring</a> is attacked, but also when <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_spider\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Phase spider\">Phase spiders</a> are attacked in <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_notes\" title=\"Patch notes\">Hotfix #27</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_notes\" title=\"Patch notes\">Hotfix #28</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb\">Sources of Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb\" title=\"Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb\" title=\"Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb\">Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb\">Creatures with Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/30px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/45px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/60px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/30px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Spend a legendary action to trap a <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spiderling\" title=\"Phase Spiderling\">Phase Spiderling</a> attacker in a Gossamer Tomb.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714233953\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐